Merchant acknowledges the MacGuffin.
Merchant wrongly believes Tom is at Market.

Tom is at Home.
Tom has 1 money.
Tom does not acknowledge Merchant.
Tom acknowledges Home.
Tom does not acknowledge Market.
Tom acknowledges the MacGuffin.

